            "text": "theorem energy_past (w : ResetWitness d K) (Amp : ℝ → ℝ) (eta : ℝ) :\n    IntegrableOn (fun y => energyWeight w Amp (y, eta)) (Iic (0 : ℝ)) ∧\n      (∫ y in Iic (0 : ℝ), energyWeight w Amp (y, eta)) = initialS d eta"
